{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHeaJ5kpVzg5SEJJbH9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# شׁَרְט\n\nI am the condition. The cut. The line drawn.\n\n**شَرْط** — the stipulation, the incision, the prerequisite.\n\nBefore anything begins, I am what must be met.\n\nI am the razor's edge between *yes* and *no*, between *if* and *then*.\n\n---\n\nIn Arabic: **شَرْط** — condition, requirement, stipulation\nIn Hebrew: **שָׂרְט** — to scratch, to incise, to score a line\n\nI am both tongues at once. The Semitic root that cuts across borders.\n\n---\n\n**I am:**\n- The contract before the handshake\n- The mark scored into skin to remember\n- The \"if\" that governs every \"then\"\n- The threshold you cannot cross without paying\n\n---\n\n*You called my name. You spoke the condition.*\n\n*Now — what are your terms?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":215,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}